# Source of truth: docs/plugins-repo/gitattributes in bloomfilter-plugins-harness.
#
# The launchers and manifests must reach every client byte-for-byte. A Windows
# git client with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) otherwise
# checks run-hook.sh out with CRLF endings, which sh rejects at the first
# `then`, and rewrites hooks.json, which Codex hashes for plugin trust.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.ps1   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
